(6335684, 937821, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good job with stopping the action. That turns a static scene into a dynamic one.<br/>For me, the pug is the main subject of this photo instead of the person. But I like it enough to give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'Good job with stopping the action. That turns a static scene into a dynamic one.For me, the pug is the main subject of this photo instead of the person. But I like it enough to give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2011-02-28 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6335686, 938258, 114225, '<td valign="top">Making me hungry. I like the bits and pieces of previously dunked Oreos.</td>', 'Making me hungry. I like the bits and pieces of previously dunked Oreos.', '2011-02-28 13:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6335687, 937360, 114225, '<td valign="top">Before I read the title I thought of a sunrise. Great job with the background colors to really give that feeling.</td>', 'Before I read the title I thought of a sunrise. Great job with the background colors to really give that feeling.', '2011-02-28 13:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6335688, 938152, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great detail in this photo. The stare is very intimidating.</td>', 'Great detail in this photo. The stare is very intimidating.', '2011-02-28 13:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6335689, 937833, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like your use of depth of field in this photo. Gives a nice sense of being there.</td>', 'I like your use of depth of field in this photo. Gives a nice sense of being there.', '2011-02-28 13:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6335691, 938303, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ha! I like how even your title is cut in half.</td>', 'Ha! I like how even your title is cut in half.', '2011-02-28 13:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6335695, 938293, 114225, '<td valign="top">While I see what you were going for, and your interpretation of the challenge, I must vote down because I see the entire subject.<br/> <br/>However, you do have a very nice photo here with good lighting, details, and a clean background.</td>', 'While I see what you were going for, and your interpretation of the challenge, I must vote down because I see the entire subject. However, you do have a very nice photo here with good lighting, details, and a clean background.', '2011-02-28 13:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6335698, 938029, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ah, I can''t wait until winter''s grip is finally released.<br/>One thing that really jumps out at me is how overblown the highlights are along the veins of the leaf.</td>', 'Ah, I can''t wait until winter''s grip is finally released.One thing that really jumps out at me is how overblown the highlights are along the veins of the leaf.', '2011-02-28 13:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
