(6335704, 938072, 20577, '<td valign="top">I like this picture very much. Has an artistic quality about it, but I just can''t find the "Half" part. I wish I could give you a higher score, but... 6</td>', 'I like this picture very much. Has an artistic quality about it, but I just can''t find the "Half" part. I wish I could give you a higher score, but... 6', '2011-02-28 13:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
