(6335727, 938272, 114225, '<td valign="top">Yikes! A Zombie!!<br/>The selective de-saturation of her face makes it look like she wants to eat my brains.</td>', 'Yikes! A Zombie!!The selective de-saturation of her face makes it look like she wants to eat my brains.', '2011-02-28 14:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6335728, 937910, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wunderful colors and details in this photo.</td>', 'Wunderful colors and details in this photo.', '2011-02-28 14:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6335730, 938293, 20577, '<td valign="top">I think this picture would have been great had the background been more white. A cool trick I recently learned was to make a curves adjustment layer in Photoshop and take the little white eyedropper and click on the white portion of the background and it will usually "fix" the coloring issue (you may have to click on different location until you find the right "white"). If you don''t have Photoshop I apologize...</td>', 'I think this picture would have been great had the background been more white. A cool trick I recently learned was to make a curves adjustment layer in Photoshop and take the little white eyedropper and click on the white portion of the background and it will usually "fix" the coloring issue (you may have to click on different location until you find the right "white"). If you don''t have Photoshop I apologize...', '2011-02-28 14:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6335731, 937447, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is jello? Nice clean lines and lighting.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is jello? Nice clean lines and lighting.', '2011-02-28 14:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
