(6335755, 938175, 29777, '<td valign="top">I think this would be more interesting with more of an angle to the subject. The shadow of the sign and the light on the wall is a nice touch. Overall seems a bit soft or that noise is getting into the shot.</td>', 'I think this would be more interesting with more of an angle to the subject. The shadow of the sign and the light on the wall is a nice touch. Overall seems a bit soft or that noise is getting into the shot.', '2011-02-28 14:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6335756, 938072, 29777, '<td valign="top">Very impressionistic. To me it looks like a dog on the snowy bank of a river or lake. Maybe something is in or near the water line? hard to tell.</td>', 'Very impressionistic. To me it looks like a dog on the snowy bank of a river or lake. Maybe something is in or near the water line? hard to tell.', '2011-02-28 14:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
