(6338852, 938072, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ll take the door with the goat.  Thank you.</td>', 'I''ll take the door with the goat.  Thank you.', '2011-03-02 11:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338883, 937897, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph, in the distinctive Gershwin style.  I do like the theme of industrial structures as art.  Somebody did it long ago, but I forget who it was ... a wife-husband team I think, in Europe.  Anyway, it is very effectively done here in a modern iteration by you.  Thank you.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph, in the distinctive Gershwin style.  I do like the theme of industrial structures as art.  Somebody did it long ago, but I forget who it was ... a wife-husband team I think, in Europe.  Anyway, it is very effectively done here in a modern iteration by you.  Thank you.', '2011-03-02 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338892, 938081, 30364, '<td valign="top">''Tis grand.  Thank you.</td>', '''Tis grand.  Thank you.', '2011-03-02 11:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338898, 938224, 30364, '<td valign="top">Elegantly done.  Nice to see some thought not just about the picture but about another level of meaning to the challenge theme.  Well done on both counts.  Thank you.</td>', 'Elegantly done.  Nice to see some thought not just about the picture but about another level of meaning to the challenge theme.  Well done on both counts.  Thank you.', '2011-03-02 11:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338904, 937798, 30364, '<td valign="top">On the brink of overdone, but not quite.  It works.  Thank you.</td>', 'On the brink of overdone, but not quite.  It works.  Thank you.', '2011-03-02 11:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338910, 937133, 30364, '<td valign="top">If you ain''t <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=11769" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jmritz</a> then you owe him a beer.  If you are then you owe me one.  Thank you.</td>', 'If you ain''t  jmritz then you owe him a beer.  If you are then you owe me one.  Thank you.', '2011-03-02 11:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338911, 937974, 11769, '<td valign="top">Is this person skating? Beautiful photograph.</td>', 'Is this person skating? Beautiful photograph.', '2011-03-02 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338912, 937794, 11769, '<td valign="top">I''m not exactly sure what this is but I do like the abstract quality. Fascinating use of rectangles.</td>', 'I''m not exactly sure what this is but I do like the abstract quality. Fascinating use of rectangles.', '2011-03-02 11:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338913, 938279, 11769, '<td valign="top">Nice use of blur.</td>', 'Nice use of blur.', '2011-03-02 11:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338915, 936930, 11769, '<td valign="top">Solemn contemplative beautiful photography.</td>', 'Solemn contemplative beautiful photography.', '2011-03-02 11:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338917, 938172, 30364, '<td valign="top">Just too perfectly anthropomorphic to dismiss.  It''s fun and very well done.  Thank you.</td>', 'Just too perfectly anthropomorphic to dismiss.  It''s fun and very well done.  Thank you.', '2011-03-02 11:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338918, 938081, 11769, '<td valign="top">No horizontal, dang. I guess trees which is unnecessary to enjoy this. I see vertical blur running the length of the image, love to see this 10 feet tall on a wall somewhere.</td>', 'No horizontal, dang. I guess trees which is unnecessary to enjoy this. I see vertical blur running the length of the image, love to see this 10 feet tall on a wall somewhere.', '2011-03-02 11:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338919, 938035, 11769, '<td valign="top">Their gaze is so intent. Dogs were made for this challenge along with being our best friends. Love the rolling hills and the color. 10</td>', 'Their gaze is so intent. Dogs were made for this challenge along with being our best friends. Love the rolling hills and the color. 10', '2011-03-02 11:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338920, 938072, 11769, '<td valign="top">This is all I need. Wow, what a wonderful image.</td>', 'This is all I need. Wow, what a wonderful image.', '2011-03-02 11:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338921, 937821, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love the look the little one has. It must be tough to be a Pug Walker.</td>', 'Love the look the little one has. It must be tough to be a Pug Walker.', '2011-03-02 11:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338926, 937824, 11769, '<td valign="top">I think you covered all the halves. This is great.</td>', 'I think you covered all the halves. This is great.', '2011-03-02 11:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338927, 938217, 11769, '<td valign="top">Stunning image</td>', 'Stunning image', '2011-03-02 11:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338929, 938273, 11769, '<td valign="top">Powerful image, I like.</td>', 'Powerful image, I like.', '2011-03-02 11:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338933, 937605, 11769, '<td valign="top">Controlled blur. What a heavenly sight. Beautiful photography and art.</td>', 'Controlled blur. What a heavenly sight. Beautiful photography and art.', '2011-03-02 11:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338947, 938236, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  And I mean that literally:<br/> <br/><i>adjective<br/>1.  charmingly or exquisitely beautiful: a lovely flower.<br/>2.  having a beauty that appeals to the heart or mind as well as to the eye, as a person or a face.<br/>3.  delightful; highly pleasing: to have a lovely time.<br/>4.  of a great moral or spiritual beauty: a lovely character.</i> <br/> <br/>Thank you</td>', 'Lovely.  And I mean that literally: adjective1.  charmingly or exquisitely beautiful: a lovely flower.2.  having a beauty that appeals to the heart or mind as well as to the eye, as a person or a face.3.  delightful; highly pleasing: to have a lovely time.4.  of a great moral or spiritual beauty: a lovely character.  Thank you', '2011-03-02 11:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6338960, 937821, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  So hard to take a really good dog photograph that''s charming and not just mawkish.  You''ve broken through that barrier superbly.  Worthy of Erwitt.  Thank you.</td>', 'Beautifully done.  So hard to take a really good dog photograph that''s charming and not just mawkish.  You''ve broken through that barrier superbly.  Worthy of Erwitt.  Thank you.', '2011-03-02 12:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339001, 938273, 118154, '<td valign="top">Like the idea.</td>', 'Like the idea.', '2011-03-02 12:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339239, 938090, 20799, '<td valign="top">Lovely color and texture.</td>', 'Lovely color and texture.', '2011-03-02 14:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339243, 937974, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Everything inhabits just half of the frame, and yet it must have the other half in order to breathe.  The photograph lives right in the rarefied zone between literalism and impressionism; I half close my eyes and it teeters toward the figurative, open them again and it eases me back toward the reassuringly corporeal.  Very fine and satisfying picture and in my top 3 for this challenge.  Thank you.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Everything inhabits just half of the frame, and yet it must have the other half in order to breathe.  The photograph lives right in the rarefied zone between literalism and impressionism; I half close my eyes and it teeters toward the figurative, open them again and it eases me back toward the reassuringly corporeal.  Very fine and satisfying picture and in my top 3 for this challenge.  Thank you.', '2011-03-02 14:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339246, 938075, 30364, '<td valign="top">Can''t not love this!  It''s wonderfully loose and yet eloquent, so sure of itself that it can afford to be uncommonly bold.  Just like a great drawing!  Top 2 for me.  Thank you.</td>', 'Can''t not love this!  It''s wonderfully loose and yet eloquent, so sure of itself that it can afford to be uncommonly bold.  Just like a great drawing!  Top 2 for me.  Thank you.', '2011-03-02 14:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6339258, 936930, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s rare anyone offers anything this photographically articulate at DPC.   I hope that it might receive the attention it deserves but, alas, I expect that it won''t.  Unquestionably the Best in Show.  Thank you.</td>', 'It''s rare anyone offers anything this photographically articulate at DPC.   I hope that it might receive the attention it deserves but, alas, I expect that it won''t.  Unquestionably the Best in Show.  Thank you.', '2011-03-02 14:57:12.000000', NULL, 1);
