(6340275, 937317, 101702, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. A nice crisp shot of a crisp apple, but to me the subject is half an apple and this is a photo of the full subject. I''m probably being ultra-picky but I''m feeling this isn''t quite what the challenge is aiming for. Therefore I''m knocking a couple of points off for my perception that this doesn''t quite meet the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm. A nice crisp shot of a crisp apple, but to me the subject is half an apple and this is a photo of the full subject. I''m probably being ultra-picky but I''m feeling this isn''t quite what the challenge is aiming for. Therefore I''m knocking a couple of points off for my perception that this doesn''t quite meet the challenge.', '2011-03-03 16:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6340280, 938081, 101702, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Exactly what is this half of? A nice abstract but I can''t really say that I feel this meets the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm. Exactly what is this half of? A nice abstract but I can''t really say that I feel this meets the challenge.', '2011-03-03 16:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
