(6344097, 938150, 62357, '<td valign="top">I think the comment you just received nailed it on the head!  I was just writing at the same time he did, that I suspect most people thought this was DNMC.  Very few people in the DPC community would know that this famous Liverpool landmark is known for the pair of birds on the building.</td>', 'I think the comment you just received nailed it on the head!  I was just writing at the same time he did, that I suspect most people thought this was DNMC.  Very few people in the DPC community would know that this famous Liverpool landmark is known for the pair of birds on the building.', '2011-03-07 12:28:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6344105, 937666, 67152, '<td valign="top">I think many of us don''t know what downtown Miami looks like and hence this was a risky shot to enter.  I did not vote on the challenge, but I would likely have given this no more than a 5.<br/> <br/>Remember that we need obviousness with challenges, so while it was a creative take, I think it missed the mark.  maybe cropping off the tops of the buildings so that we only see ''half'' may have been a more direct connection to the challenge.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I think many of us don''t know what downtown Miami looks like and hence this was a risky shot to enter.  I did not vote on the challenge, but I would likely have given this no more than a 5. Remember that we need obviousness with challenges, so while it was a creative take, I think it missed the mark.  maybe cropping off the tops of the buildings so that we only see ''half'' may have been a more direct connection to the challenge. ', '2011-03-07 12:39:05.000000', NULL, 0),
